# Past the edge (C2 look A, the tucked page). First a rumour of it on the beyond map; then every
# place past the fence opens, so the map stops at a torn edge with a signpost ("the edge") and the
# next page tucked under it ("500 to go"). Tap the signpost, pick a shelf, send 1 / 10 / 100 / all:
# they never come back, and the page fills with their scribbles until it's full (the next page's
# unlock opens quietly here: its own step adds the page and its popup).
from rich
view full
stickers off                  # new pets here can fill a book page: no sticker popups over the shots
pets 6
herd common normal 3000
herd uncommon normal 800
herd rare normal 120
herd epic normal 12
unlock page:beyond
unlock location:orchard
rumour edge
map-page beyond
wait 1
expect fits
shot rumour
lead well
lead cellar
lead below
wait popup
expect text "new: the edge!"
expect fits
shot popup
click "lovely"
map-page beyond
wait 1
expect no-text "they'll draw the rest of the map!"
expect fits
shot edge_map
edge
wait 1
expect text "they'll draw the rest of the map!"
expect text "uncommon"
expect fits
shot edge_card
click "100"
wait 1.5
expect fits
shot after_100
click "uncommon"
click "10"
wait 0.5
click "rare"
click "10"
wait 1
expect fits
shot mixed
click "common"
click "all"
wait 1.5
expect no-text "uncommon"
expect fits
shot full
